### 1. Happy-path Create Order -> 201 Created (server computes totalSantim)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Id: req-happy-001

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "customerName": "Abdi Sarbesa",
  "customerPhone": "0911223344",
  "area": "Bole",
  "deliveryMode": "ASAP",
  "tipSantim": 5000,
  "lines": [
    { "dishId": 101, "quantity": 2 },
    { "dishId": 102, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### 2. Valid Status Transition (PENDING -> PREPARING) -> 200 OK
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PREPARING"
}

### 3. Invalid Status Transition (DELIVERED -> PENDING) -> 409 Conflict
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PENDING"
}

### 4. Invalid TeleBirr Number -> 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "customerName": "Abdi Sarbesa",
  "customerPhone": "12345",
  "area": "Bole",
  "deliveryMode": "ASAP",
  "lines": [{ "dishId": 101, "quantity": 1 }]
}

### 5. Forced TypeError -> 500 Internal Server Error (no stack trace)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/debug/boom
### 6. Unknown Extra Field (forbidNonWhitelisted) -> 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "customerName": "Bekele Abebe",
  "customerPhone": "0911223344",
  "area": "Bole",
  "deliveryMode": "ASAP",
  "totalSantim": 9999999,
  "lines": [{ "dishId": 101, "quantity": 1 }]
}

### 7. Missing Restaurant (Existence Guard) -> 404 Not Found
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 999,
  "customerName": "Bekele Abebe",
  "customerPhone": "0911223344",
  "area": "Bole",
  "deliveryMode": "ASAP",
  "lines": [{ "dishId": 101, "quantity": 1 }]
}

### 8. Missing Dish (Existence Guard) -> 404 Not Found
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "customerName": "Bekele Abebe",
  "customerPhone": "0911223344",
  "area": "Bole",
  "deliveryMode": "ASAP",
  "lines": [{ "dishId": 999, "quantity": 1 }]
}

### 9. Closed Restaurant (State Guard) -> 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 2,
  "customerName": "Bekele Abebe",
  "customerPhone": "0911223344",
  "area": "Piazza",
  "deliveryMode": "ASAP",
  "lines": [{ "dishId": 201, "quantity": 1 }]
}

### 10. Sold-Out Dish (State Guard) -> 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "customerName": "Bekele Abebe",
  "customerPhone": "0911223344",
  "area": "Bole",
  "deliveryMode": "ASAP",
  "lines": [{ "dishId": 103, "quantity": 1 }]
}

### 11. Dish Belongs to Different Restaurant (Relationship Guard) -> 422 Unprocessable Entity
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "customerName": "Bekele Abebe",
  "customerPhone": "0911223344",
  "area": "Bole",
  "deliveryMode": "ASAP",
  "lines": [{ "dishId": 201, "quantity": 1 }]
}

### 12. Invalid Status Transition -> 409 Conflict
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PENDING"
}